[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3065.51, "timestamp": "00:51:05", "text": "是的。  我的天啊。  聽著，像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3071.67, "timestamp": "00:51:11", "text": "你們這樣的水還在這裡。  我們需要水下呼吸。我們他媽的沒辦法在水下呼吸。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3076.39, "timestamp": "00:51:16", "text": "嚴格來說，本來可以在水下呼吸，但實際上他並沒有呼吸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3084.39, "timestamp": "00:51:24", "text": "哦，老兄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3088.39, "timestamp": "00:51:28", "text": "。技術上來說，他可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3091.75, "timestamp": "00:51:31", "text": "這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3103.19, "timestamp": "00:51:43", "text": "很好，因為他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3106.71, "timestamp": "00:51:46", "text": "可以呼吸了。  如果把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3108.71, "timestamp": "00:51:48", "text": "豬淹得夠深，它們也能在水下呼吸。  只要你夠努力，最終就能永遠待在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3110.15, "timestamp": "00:51:50", "text": "水下。  是的。我的"}]